  "details": "Hello VRChat Support Team,\n\nI am writing to report a persistent issue I am facing with VRChat. Every time I try to join a world, the game kicks me out after a short period.\n\nThe game often freezes, and I receive an error message stating that \"VRChat is not responding.\" This happens repeatedly, making it impossible for me to enjoy the game.\n\nCould you please help me resolve this issue? Let me know if you need any log files or system specifications to investigate this further.\n\nThank you for your time and assistance",
